{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated Barovia sound set. Source of truth for download-sounds.sh and register-sounds.js.",
    "Each entry names the exact output filename, so the generated configs are deterministic.",
    "'query' is a YouTube search — the downloader takes the first result matching the",
    "duration filter for its category (ambience: 10-90 min loops; one-shots: <= 8 s,",
    "then hard-capped to 6 s). One-shots are punctuation: keep queries pointed at a",
    "single short hit, and avoid 'ambience', 'loop', '1 hour' and 'compilation', which",
    "is how the first pass ended up with a three-minute thunderstorm.",
    "Swap a query and re-run the script if a result is poor; delete the mp3 first to refetch."
  ],
